  'Closed. The platform team is locked out.': ['Kiggale. Ttiimu ya pulatifomu teyingira.', 'Imefungwa. Timu ya jukwaa haiwezi kuingia.'],
  'Closed. The platform team sees only totals, like how many members you have. Nobody can see your names, phones or money unless you open this.': ['Kiggale. Ttiimu ya pulatifomu eraba miwendo gyokka, nga bammemba bameka be mulina. Tewali asobola kulaba mannya gammwe, ssimu oba ssente okuggyako ng\'oggudde kino.', 'Imefungwa. Timu ya jukwaa inaona jumla tu, kama idadi ya wanachama wenu. Hakuna anayeweza kuona majina, simu au pesa zenu isipokuwa ukifungua hii.'],
