  'Confirmed and posted to the ledger.': ['Kikakasiddwa era kiwandiikiddwa mu kitabo.', 'Imethibitishwa na kuingizwa kwenye leja.'],
  'Connect a gateway': ['Yunga omukutu gw\'okusasula', 'Unganisha lango la malipo'],
  'Connect your group\'s OWN Flutterwave or Pesapal account. Money goes straight to the group. Each payment is confirmed by the gateway and checked again by our server, so nobody types a transaction ID.': ['Yunga akawunti ya Flutterwave oba Pesapal ey\'ekibiina kyo KYENNYINI. Ssente zigenda butereevu mu kibiina. Buli kusasula kukakasibwa omukutu ne kuddamu okukeberwa sseva yaffe, kale tewali awandiika ID y\'okusasula.', 'Unganisha akaunti ya Flutterwave au Pesapal ya kikundi chenu WENYEWE. Pesa huenda moja kwa moja kwa kikundi. Kila malipo huthibitishwa na lango na kukaguliwa tena na seva yetu, hivyo hakuna anayeandika ID ya muamala.'],
  'Connected. The keys worked and are now locked on the server.': ['Kiyungiddwa. Ebisumuluzo bikoze era kati bisibiddwa ku sseva.', 'Imeunganishwa. Funguo zimefanya kazi na sasa zimefungwa kwenye seva.'],
