  'Continue standard weekly meeting reconciliation and dual-counter verification.': ['Mweyongere n\'okugeraageranya ssente okwa buli wiiki mu lukiiko n\'ababazi ababiri okukakasa.', 'Endeleeni na ulinganishaji wa kawaida wa mkutano wa kila wiki na uhakiki wa wahesabuji wawili.'],
  'Continue with Google': ['Weeyongere ne Google', 'Endelea na Google'],
  'Contribute': ['Waayo', 'Changia'],
  'Copied as CSV. Paste it in a spreadsheet.': ['Kikoppeddwa nga CSV. Kiteeke mu spreadsheet.', 'Imenakiliwa kama CSV. Ibandike kwenye lahajedwali.'],
