  'Could not open the dialer. Number copied.': ['Tekisobose kuggulawo wa kukubira ssimu. Ennamba ekoppeddwa.', 'Imeshindwa kufungua kipiga simu. Namba imenakiliwa.'],
  'Could not open the payment page. Link copied: paste it in your browser.': ['Tekisobose kuggulawo lupapula lwa kusasula. Linki ekoppeddwa: giteeke mu browser yo.', 'Imeshindwa kufungua ukurasa wa malipo. Kiungo kimenakiliwa: kibandike kwenye kivinjari chako.'],
  'Could not open the policy. Please try again.': ['Tekisobose kuggulawo nkola. Ddamu ogezeeko.', 'Imeshindwa kufungua sera. Tafadhali jaribu tena.'],
  'Count differs from the ledger. Find out why before closing.': ['Ezibaliddwa tezikwatagana na kitabo. Zuula lwaki nga tonnaggalawo.', 'Hesabu inatofautiana na leja. Tafuta sababu kabla ya kufunga.'],
  'Counted at meetings': ['Ezibalibwa mu nkiiko', 'Huhesabiwa mikutanoni'],
