  'Country saved.': ['Eggwanga literekeddwa.', 'Nchi imehifadhiwa.'],
  'Covers gateways, aggregators, integrators and e-money. Needed if the company collects, holds or routes money, for example one shared collection account. Lowest capital reported: UGX 100m (operator), UGX 250m (e-money issuer). Avoid it by keeping "groups use their own accounts".': ['Kikwata ku mikutu gy\'okusasula, abagatta, abayunga ne e-money. Kyetaagisa singa kkampuni ekuŋŋaanya, ekwata oba eyisa ssente, okugeza akawunti emu ey\'okukuŋŋaanyizaamu eya bonna. Kapito asinga obutono eyalangibwa: UGX 100m (omuddukanya), UGX 250m (afulumya e-money). Kyewale ng\'okuuma "ebibiina bikozesa akawunti zaabyo".', 'Inahusu malango ya malipo, wakusanyaji, waunganishaji na pesa za kielektroniki. Inahitajika kama kampuni inakusanya, inashika au inapitisha pesa, kwa mfano akaunti moja ya pamoja ya makusanyo. Mtaji wa chini ulioripotiwa: UGX 100m (mwendeshaji), UGX 250m (mtoaji wa pesa za kielektroniki). Iepuke kwa kubaki na "vikundi vinatumia akaunti zao".'],
