  'Each row seals the one before it. If anyone changes an old row, this check fails.': ['Buli lunyiriri lusiba olulukulembera. Omuntu yenna bw\'akyusa olunyiriri olukadde, okukebera kuno kugwa.', 'Kila mstari hufunga ule wa kabla yake. Mtu akibadilisha mstari wa zamani, ukaguzi huu unashindwa.'],
