  'Encourage qualified members with solid savings records to apply for seasonal loans.': ['Kubiriza bammemba abasaanidde era abatereka obulungi okusaba amabanja ag\'ebiseera.', 'Wahimize wanachama wanaostahili wenye rekodi nzuri za akiba kuomba mikopo ya msimu.'],
  'End of cycle payouts, largest remainder': ['Okusasula ku nkomerero y\'ekiseera, ekisigalira ekisinga', 'Malipo ya mwisho wa mzunguko, salio kubwa zaidi'],
  'Ends {0}': ['Kiggwa {0}', 'Inaisha {0}'],
  'Enter a valid amount.': ['Wandiika omuwendo omutuufu.', 'Weka kiasi sahihi.'],
  'Enter a valid email.': ['Wandiika email entuufu.', 'Andika email sahihi.'],
  'Enter a valid phone like {0}, or an email.': ['Wandiika ennamba y\'essimu entuufu nga {0}, oba email.', 'Weka namba ya simu sahihi kama {0}, au barua pepe.'],
  'Enter amount and term (1 to 60 months).': ['Wandiika omuwendo n\'ebbanga (emyezi 1 okutuuka ku 60).', 'Weka kiasi na muda (miezi 1 hadi 60).'],
  'Enter an amount and the number of months.': ['Wandiika omuwendo n\'emyezi emeka.', 'Weka kiasi na idadi ya miezi.'],
  'Enter the amount.': ['Wandiika omuwendo gwa ssente.', 'Weka kiasi.'],
  'Enter the cash and choose two counters.': ['Wandiika ssente era olonde ababazi babiri.', 'Weka pesa taslimu na uchague wahesabuji wawili.'],
  'Enter the committee resolution reference.': ['Wandiika ennamba y\'ekisalibwawo kya kakiiko.', 'Andika namba ya azimio la kamati.'],
  'Enter the transaction ID from the mobile money or bank message.': ['Wandiika transaction ID eri mu bubaka bwa mobile money oba obwa bbanka.', 'Andika transaction ID iliyo kwenye ujumbe wa mobile money au wa benki.'],
  'Enter the transaction ID.': ['Wandiika ID y\'okusasula.', 'Weka ID ya muamala.'],
  'Enter your app PIN': ['Wandiika PIN yo eya app', 'Weka PIN yako ya programu'],
  'Every amount is written twice: where it came from and where it went. The two sides must always be equal. If they are not, something is wrong and the app shows it at once.': ['Buli muwendo guwandiikibwa emirundi ebiri: gye gwava ne gye gwagenda. Enjuyi zombi zirina okwenkana bulijjo. Bwe zitenkana, waliwo ekikyamu era app ekiraga amangu ago.', 'Kila kiasi huandikwa mara mbili: kilikotoka na kilikokwenda. Pande mbili lazima zilingane kila wakati. Zisipolingana, kuna kosa na programu inaonyesha mara moja.'],
  'Every circle I am in and my role there, invitations, start or join a circle': ['Buli kibiina mwe ndi n\'omulimu gwange, okuyitibwa, okutandika oba okwegatta ku kibiina', 'Kila kikundi nilichomo na nafasi yangu, mialiko, anzisha au jiunge na kikundi'],
  'Every day': ['Buli lunaku', 'Kila siku'],
  'Every group on the platform, administrators, account closing requests': ['Buli kibiina ku mukutu, abakulembeze, okusaba okuggalawo akawunti', 'Kila kikundi kwenye jukwaa, wasimamizi, maombi ya kufunga akaunti'],
  'Every month': ['Buli mwezi', 'Kila mwezi'],
  'Every phone and browser using your account will be signed out, this one too. Records you saved are not lost.': ['Buli ssimu ne browser ebikozesa akawunti yo bijja kufulumizibwa, ne kino. Ebiwandiiko bye waterese tebibula.', 'Kila simu na kivinjari kinachotumia akaunti yako kitatolewa, hiki pia. Rekodi ulizohifadhi hazipotei.'],
  'Every shilling is given out. Nothing is left over or missing.': ['Buli siringi egabibwa. Tewali kisigalawo wadde ekibula.', 'Kila shilingi inagawiwa. Hakuna kinachobaki wala kupotea.'],
  'Every shilling is written in the ledger and sealed. Mistakes get a visible correction, never a secret delete. Tap the small (i) beside any word you do not know. You can replay this tour in My Account.': ['Buli siringi ewandiikibwa mu kitabo ne kiggalwa. Ensobi zitereezebwa mu lwatu, tezisangulwa mu kyama. Nyiga aka (i) akatono akali ku kigambo ky\'otomanyi. Osobola okuddamu okulambula kuno mu Akawunti Yange.', 'Kila shilingi huandikwa kwenye leja na kufungwa. Makosa hurekebishwa waziwazi, hayafutwi kwa siri. Gusa (i) ndogo kando ya neno usilolijua. Unaweza kurudia ziara hii kwenye Akaunti Yangu.'],
  'Every shilling, on the record': ['Buli siringi, ewandiikiddwa', 'Kila shilingi, imeandikwa'],
  'Every week': ['Buli wiiki', 'Kila wiki'],
  'Every year': ['Buli mwaka', 'Kila mwaka'],
  'Every {0}': ['Buli {0}', 'Kila {0}'],
  'Everyday': ['Ekya bulijjo', 'Ya kila siku'],
  'Example: 100,000 for 3 months': ['Ekyokulabirako: 100,000 okumala emyezi 3', 'Mfano: 100,000 kwa miezi 3'],
  'Example: Savings UGX 25,000': ['Ekyokulabirako: Okutereka UGX 25,000', 'Mfano: Akiba UGX 25,000'],
  'Execute Reversal': ['Sazaamu kati', 'Tengua sasa'],
  'Expires': ['Kiggwaako', 'Inaisha'],
  'Expiry date (YYYY-MM-DD)': ['Olunaku lw\'okuggwaako (YYYY-MM-DD)', 'Tarehe ya kuisha (YYYY-MM-DD)'],
  'Explain words': ['Nnyonnyola ebigambo', 'Eleza maneno'],
  'Explain words with (i) buttons': ['Nnyonnyola ebigambo n\'obupeesa (i)', 'Eleza maneno kwa vitufe vya (i)'],
  'Extra large': ['Kinene nnyo', 'Kubwa sana'],
  'FAILED at row {0}': ['KIGAANYE ku lunyiriri {0}', 'IMESHINDWA kwenye safu {0}'],
  'Fair to the borrower: fees stop growing at this limit.': ['Kya bwenkanya eri eyeewola: ebisale tebyeyongera kusukka wano.', 'Haki kwa mkopaji: ada haziongezeki kupita kikomo hiki.'],
  'Fewer settings': ['Entegeka ntono', 'Mipangilio michache'],
  'Fill in group name, your name and share price.': ['Jjuzaamu erinnya ly\'ekibiina, erinnya lyo n\'omuwendo gw\'omugabo.', 'Jaza jina la kikundi, jina lako na bei ya hisa.'],
  'Fill in the goal and the boxes above to see the answer.': ['Jjuzaamu ekigendererwa n\'obubokisi waggulu olabe eky\'okuddamu.', 'Jaza lengo na visanduku vya juu ili uone jibu.'],
  'Filled from your profile. Fix them if needed. This circle\'s officers will see them.': ['Biggiddwa mu bikukwatako. Bitereeze bwe kyetaagisa. Abakulu b\'ekibiina kino bajja kubiraba.', 'Zimejazwa kutoka wasifu wako. Zirekebishe ikihitajika. Viongozi wa kikundi hiki wataziona.'],
