  'Money records': ['Ebiwandiiko bya ssente', 'Rekodi za pesa'],
  'Money stays in the one savings account. When members pay, they can label it for this goal.': ['Ssente zisigala mu akawunti emu ey\'okutereka. Bammemba bwe basasula, basobola okuzitegeka ku kigendererwa kino.', 'Pesa hubaki kwenye akaunti moja ya akiba. Wanachama wakilipa, wanaweza kuziwekea alama ya lengo hili.'],
  'Money to share': ['Ssente ez\'okugabana', 'Pesa za kugawana'],
  'Money you keep in the group. It is yours. It also decides how much you can borrow.': ['Ssente z\'otereka mu kibiina. Zizo. Era ze zisalawo ssente mmeka z\'osobola okwewola.', 'Pesa unazoweka kwenye kikundi. Ni zako. Pia zinaamua unaweza kukopa kiasi gani.'],
  'Money you put in at a fixed price, like buying small pieces of the group. At share-out you get back your shares plus your part of the profit.': ['Ssente z\'oteekamu ku muwendo ogutakyuka, ng\'agula obutundu obutono obw\'ekibiina. Mu kugabana ssente ofuna emigabo gyo n\'omugabo gwo ku magoba.', 'Pesa unazoweka kwa bei maalum, kama kununua vipande vidogo vya kikundi. Wakati wa mgawanyo unarudishiwa hisa zako pamoja na sehemu yako ya faida.'],
  'Month by month': ['Mwezi ku mwezi', 'Mwezi kwa mwezi'],
