  'Need {0}%: {1}/{2}': ['Kyetaagisa {0}%: {1}/{2}', 'Inahitajika {0}%: {1}/{2}'],
  'Needed for platform tools. Protects your account even if someone learns your password.': ['Kyetaagisa ku bikozesebwa by\'omukutu. Kikuuma akawunti yo ne bwe wabaawo ategedde ekigambo kyo eky\'ekyama.', 'Inahitajika kwa zana za jukwaa. Inalinda akaunti yako hata mtu akijua nenosiri lako.'],
