  'Needs you': ['Kikwetaaga', 'Inakuhitaji'],
  'Net {0}': ['Ekisigadde {0}', 'Baki {0}'],
  'Never': ['Tekibangawo', 'Kamwe'],
  'New accounts with a phone number are paused until we can text you a code. Use your email or Google for now.': ['Akawunti empya ez\'ennamba y\'essimu ziyimiriziddwa okutuusa lwe tunaasobola okukuweereza koodi ku ssimu. Kozesa email oba Google kati.', 'Akaunti mpya za namba ya simu zimesimamishwa hadi tuweze kukutumia msimbo. Tumia barua pepe au Google kwa sasa.'],
