  'New group goal': ['Ekigendererwa ky\'ekibiina ekipya', 'Lengo jipya la kikundi'],
  'New here? Create account': ['Oli mupya? Ggulawo akawunti', 'Mgeni hapa? Fungua akaunti'],
  'New loans use these. Loans already given keep the rules they started with.': ['Amabanja amapya gakozesa bino. Amabanja agaaweebwa edda gasigala n\'amateeka ge gaatandika nago.', 'Mikopo mipya hutumia hizi. Mikopo iliyokwisha tolewa hubaki na kanuni ilizoanza nazo.'],
  'New password': ['Ekigambo ky\'ekyama ekipya', 'Nenosiri jipya'],
  'New password again': ['Ekigambo ky\'ekyama ekipya nate', 'Nenosiri jipya tena'],
  'Newest first. ✓ = email proved (Google, or clicked our link). ? = not proved yet{0}': ['Ebipya bye bisooka. ✓ = email ekakasiddwa (Google, oba yanyiga linki yaffe). ? = tennakakasibwa{0}', 'Mpya kwanza. ✓ = barua pepe imethibitishwa (Google, au alibofya kiungo chetu). ? = bado haijathibitishwa{0}'],
  'Next': ['Ekiddako', 'Endelea'],
  'Next of kin phone, optional': ['Essimu y\'ow\'oluganda, si ya buwaze', 'Simu ya ndugu wa karibu, si lazima'],
  'Next of kin, optional': ['Ow\'oluganda ow\'okumpi, si kya buwaze', 'Ndugu wa karibu, si lazima'],
  'Next: a secure payment page opens. Pay there with mobile money or card. Then come back here.': ['Ekiddako: omuko gw\'okusasula ogw\'obukuumi gujja kuggulwawo. Sasulira eyo ne mobile money oba kaadi. Oluvannyuma komawo wano.', 'Kinachofuata: ukurasa salama wa malipo utafunguka. Lipa hapo kwa mobile money au kadi. Kisha rudi hapa.'],
  'Next: {0}': ['Ekiddako: {0}', 'Kinachofuata: {0}'],
  'No Active Meeting': ['Tewali Lukiiko Lugenda Mu Maaso', 'Hakuna Mkutano Unaoendelea'],
  'No audit records found.': ['Tewali biwandiiko bya kukebera bizuuliddwa.', 'Hakuna kumbukumbu za ukaguzi zilizopatikana.'],
  'No claims yet.': ['Tewannabaawo kusaba buyambi.', 'Bado hakuna madai.'],
  'No completed meetings in this cycle yet.': ['Tewannabaawo nkiiko ziwedde mu kiseera kino.', 'Bado hakuna mikutano iliyokamilika katika mzunguko huu.'],
  'No end date, so there is no planned line.': ['Tewali lunaku lwa kukoma, n\'olwekyo tewali lukoloboze lwa nteekateeka.', 'Hakuna tarehe ya mwisho, kwa hiyo hakuna mstari wa mpango.'],
  'No goals yet. Use the calculator above, then save it as a goal.': ['Tewannabaawo bigendererwa. Kozesa ekibalirizo waggulu, olwo okitereke ng\'ekigendererwa.', 'Bado hakuna malengo. Tumia kikokotoo hapo juu, kisha kihifadhi kama lengo.'],
  'No goals yet. Your officers can set one.': ['Tewannabaawo bigendererwa. Abakulembeze bammwe basobola okuteekawo kimu.', 'Bado hakuna malengo. Viongozi wenu wanaweza kuweka moja.'],
  'No interest': ['Tewali magoba', 'Hakuna riba'],
  'No interest. Pay back exactly what you borrowed.': ['Tewali magoba. Zzaayo ezo zennyini ze weewola.', 'Hakuna riba. Rudisha kiasi kile kile ulichokopa.'],
  'No invite for that email.': ['Tewali kuyitibwa kwa email eyo.', 'Hakuna mwaliko kwa email hiyo.'],
  'No journal postings found.': ['Tewali biwandiikiddwa mu kitabo bizuuliddwa.', 'Hakuna maingizo ya leja yaliyopatikana.'],
  'No late fee': ['Tewali ngassi ya kulwawo', 'Hakuna faini ya kuchelewa'],
