  'No name yet': ['Tewannabaawo linnya', 'Bado hakuna jina'],
  'No new money can be labelled for it. Money already collected stays in savings.': ['Tewali ssente mpya ziyinza kuteekebwa ku kyo. Ssente ezaakuŋŋaanyizibwa edda zisigala mu ssente ezitereke.', 'Hakuna pesa mpya inayoweza kuwekwa kwa ajili yake. Pesa zilizokwisha kusanywa hubaki kwenye akiba.'],
  'No payment gateway is connected.': ['Tewali ngeri ya kusasula ku mutimbagano eyungiddwako.', 'Hakuna njia ya malipo ya mtandaoni iliyounganishwa.'],
  'No payment records yet.': ['Tewannabaawo biwandiiko bya kusasula.', 'Bado hakuna rekodi za malipo.'],
  'No sign-ins recorded yet.': ['Tewannabaawo kuyingira kuwandiikiddwa.', 'Bado hakuna kuingia kulikorekodiwa.'],
  'No signal: saved. It will send when you are online.': ['Tewali netiwaaka: kiterekeddwa. Kijja kuweerezebwa ng\'ofunye yintaneeti.', 'Hakuna mtandao: imehifadhiwa. Itatumwa ukiwa mtandaoni.'],
  'No transactions in this period.': ['Tewali bikoleddwa mu bbanga lino.', 'Hakuna miamala katika kipindi hiki.'],
  'No, thanks': ['Nedda, weebale', 'Hapana, asante'],
  'Nobody joins your circle unless you agree.': ['Tewali ayingira kibiina kyo nga tokkirizza.', 'Hakuna anayejiunga na kikundi chako bila wewe kukubali.'],
  'None waiting. Data law: answer requests without delay.': ['Tewali kirindiridde. Etteeka ly\'ebikwata ku bantu: ddamu okusaba awatali kulwa.', 'Hakuna kinachosubiri. Sheria ya data: jibu maombi bila kuchelewa.'],
