  'Not connected.': ['Tekiyungiddwa.', 'Haijaunganishwa.'],
  'Not enough lending money. Available {0} (emergency fund is protected).': ['Ssente ez\'okuwola tezimala. Eziriwo {0} (ensawo y\'obuyambi ekuumibwa).', 'Pesa za kukopesha hazitoshi. Zilizopo {0} (mfuko wa dharura unalindwa).'],
  'Not enough money recorded in this channel.': ['Ssente eziwandiikiddwa mu ngeri eno tezimala.', 'Pesa zilizorekodiwa kwenye njia hii hazitoshi.'],
  'Not for any goal': ['Si ya kigendererwa kyonna', 'Si kwa lengo lolote'],
  'Not linked yet': ['Tekinnayungibwa', 'Bado haijaunganishwa'],
  'Not now': ['Si kati', 'Si sasa'],
  'Not paid yet. Finish on the payment page, then tap Check again.': ['Tennasasulwa. Maliriza ku muko gw\'okusasula, olwo onyige Kebera nate.', 'Bado haijalipwa. Maliza kwenye ukurasa wa malipo, kisha gusa Angalia tena.'],
  'Not paid. {0}': ['Tekisasuddwa. {0}', 'Haijalipwa. {0}'],
  'Not proved • ': ['Tekikakasiddwa • ', 'Haijathibitishwa • '],
  'Not proved: {0}': ['Tekikakasiddwa: {0}', 'Haijathibitishwa: {0}'],
  'Not ready to close yet': ['Tekinnatuuka kuggalwa', 'Bado haiko tayari kufungwa'],
  'Not you? Change your password, then sign out of all devices.': ['Si ggwe? Kyusa ekigambo kyo eky\'ekyama, olwo ofulume ku byuma byonna.', 'Si wewe? Badilisha nenosiri lako, kisha toka kwenye vifaa vyote.'],
  'Note for the record': ['Ebigambo by\'okujjukira', 'Maelezo kwa kumbukumbu'],
  'Nothing found. Try fewer letters, or a phone number or transaction ID.': ['Tewali kizuuliddwa. Gezaako ennukuta ntono, oba ennamba y\'essimu oba ID y\'okusasula.', 'Hakuna kilichopatikana. Jaribu herufi chache, au namba ya simu au ID ya muamala.'],
  'Nothing is added': ['Tewali kyongerwako', 'Hakuna kinachoongezwa'],
  'Nothing to share yet. Savings show here once members pay.': ['Tewannabaawo kya kugabana. Ssente ezitereke zirabika wano nga bammemba basasudde.', 'Bado hakuna cha kugawana. Akiba huonekana hapa wanachama wakilipa.'],
  'Nothing waiting. All records are checked.': ['Tewali kirindiridde. Ebiwandiiko byonna bikebeddwa.', 'Hakuna kinachosubiri. Rekodi zote zimekaguliwa.'],
  'Now using your group\'s rules.': ['Kati tukozesa amateeka g\'ekibiina kyo.', 'Sasa inatumia kanuni za kikundi chako.'],
  'Number': ['Ennamba', 'Namba'],
  'Number of shares ({0} each)': ['Omuwendo gw\'emigabo ({0} buli gumu)', 'Idadi ya hisa ({0} kila moja)'],
  'ON TRACK': ['KITAMBULA BULUNGI', 'INAENDA VIZURI'],
  'OPEN NOW': ['KIGGULE KATI', 'WAZI SASA'],
  'Oct': ['Oki', 'Okt'],
  'Off. Ask for a PIN when the app opens.': ['Kiggyiddwako. Saba PIN nga app eggulwawo.', 'Imezimwa. Omba PIN app inapofunguka.'],
  'Off. Recommended for admins and treasurers: a stolen password alone will not open your account.': ['Kiggyiddwako. Kirungi eri abakulembeze n\'abawanika: ekigambo ky\'ekyama ekibbiddwa kyokka tekijja kuggula akawunti yo.', 'Imezimwa. Inashauriwa kwa wasimamizi na waweka hazina: nenosiri lililoibwa pekee halitafungua akaunti yako.'],
  'Officers see the change in the audit trail.': ['Abakulembeze balaba enkyukakyuka mu biwandiiko by\'okukebera.', 'Viongozi huona badiliko kwenye kumbukumbu za ukaguzi.'],
  'Offline: showing the last saved records': ['Tewali yintaneeti: tulaga ebiwandiiko ebyasembayo okuterekebwa', 'Nje ya mtandao: inaonyesha rekodi za mwisho zilizohifadhiwa'],
  'On this phone? Open the app instead': ['Oli ku ssimu eno? Ggulawo app mu kifo ky\'ekyo', 'Uko kwenye simu hii? Fungua app badala yake'],
  'On time': ['Mu budde', 'Kwa wakati'],
  'On track': ['Kitambula bulungi', 'Inaenda vizuri'],
  'On. After your password, the app asks for a code from your authenticator app.': ['Kiteereddwako. Oluvannyuma lw\'ekigambo ky\'ekyama, app ekusaba koodi okuva mu app yo ey\'okukakasa.', 'Imewashwa. Baada ya nenosiri, app huomba msimbo kutoka kwa app yako ya uthibitishaji.'],
  'On. Asks after 1 minute away. Only on this device.': ['Kiteereddwako. Kisaba oluvannyuma lwa ddakiika 1 nga toliiwo. Ku kyuma kino kyokka.', 'Imewashwa. Huuliza baada ya dakika 1 ukiwa mbali. Kwenye kifaa hiki tu.'],
  'Once': ['Omulundi gumu', 'Mara moja'],
  'One % on the whole loan': ['% emu ku bbanja lyonna', '% moja kwa mkopo wote'],
  'One file with your profile, statements, payments and loans.': ['Fayiro emu erimu ebikukwatako, sitetimenti, okusasula n\'amabanja.', 'Faili moja yenye wasifu wako, taarifa, malipo na mikopo.'],
  'One more step': ['Eddaala limu erisigadde', 'Hatua moja zaidi'],
  'One payment on': ['Okusasula kumu nga', 'Malipo ya mara moja tarehe'],
  'One payment on the last day': ['Okusasula kumu ku lunaku olusembayo', 'Malipo ya mara moja siku ya mwisho'],
  'One person records a payment, a different person confirms it. Nobody can add money to the books alone, so honest mistakes and tricks are caught.': ['Omuntu omu awandiika okusasula, omulala n\'akukakasa. Tewali ayinza kwongera ssente mu bitabo yekka, n\'olwekyo ensobi n\'obukumpanya bikwatibwa.', 'Mtu mmoja anarekodi malipo, mtu mwingine anayathibitisha. Hakuna anayeweza kuongeza pesa kwenye vitabu peke yake, hivyo makosa na udanganyifu hugunduliwa.'],
  'One saving period, often 9 to 12 months, that ends with a share-out. Then a new cycle starts.': ['Ekiseera kimu eky\'okutereka, emirundi mingi emyezi 9 okutuuka ku 12, ekikoma n\'okugabana ssente. Olwo ekiseera ekipya ne kitandika.', 'Kipindi kimoja cha kuweka akiba, mara nyingi miezi 9 hadi 12, kinachoisha kwa mgawanyo. Kisha mzunguko mpya huanza.'],
  'One-time': ['Omulundi gumu', 'Mara moja'],
  'Online payment is not switched on for this group.': ['Okusasula ku mutimbagano tekunnateekebwako mu kibiina kino.', 'Malipo ya mtandaoni hayajawashwa kwa kikundi hiki.'],
  'Online payment is switched off for this group.': ['Okusasula ku yintaneeti kuggyiddwako mu kibiina kino.', 'Malipo ya mtandaoni yamezimwa kwa kikundi hiki.'],
  'Online payment not found.': ['Okusasula ku mutimbagano tekusangiddwa.', 'Malipo ya mtandaoni hayajapatikana.'],
  'Online payments': ['Okusasula ku yintaneeti', 'Malipo ya mtandaoni'],
  'Online payments are switched off for now. Pay with MoMo or Airtel to the group\'s number and record the transaction ID.': ['Okusasula ku mutimbagano kuggyiddwako kaakano. Sasula ne MoMo oba Airtel ku nnamba y\'ekibiina owandiike transaction ID.', 'Malipo ya mtandaoni yamezimwa kwa sasa. Lipa kwa MoMo au Airtel kwenye namba ya kikundi kisha rekodi transaction ID.'],
  'Online payments switched off.': ['Okusasula ku yintaneeti kuggyiddwako.', 'Malipo ya mtandaoni yamezimwa.'],
  'Only for this calculator. Your group\'s rules stay the same.': ['Kya kibalirizo kino kyokka. Amateeka g\'ekibiina kyo gasigala nga bwe gali.', 'Kwa kikokotoo hiki tu. Kanuni za kikundi chako hubaki vilevile.'],
  'Only if you later move money': ['Singa oluvannyuma otambuza ssente lwokka', 'Ikiwa tu baadaye utahamisha pesa'],
  'Only if you send SMS alerts. Registered with each network. Reported at about UGX 250,000 a month per ID.': ['Singa oweereza obubaka bwa SMS lwokka. Kiwandiisibwa ku buli netiwaaka. Kigambibwa okuba nga UGX 250,000 buli mwezi ku buli ID.', 'Ikiwa tu unatuma arifa za SMS. Husajiliwa kwa kila mtandao. Inaripotiwa kuwa takriban UGX 250,000 kwa mwezi kwa kila ID.'],
  'Only money coming in can be paid online.': ['Ssente eziyingira zokka ze zisobola okusasulwa ku mutimbagano.', 'Ni pesa zinazoingia tu zinazoweza kulipwa mtandaoni.'],
  'Only officers can read the audit trail.': ['Abakulembeze bokka be basobola okusoma ebiwandiiko by\'okukebera.', 'Ni viongozi tu wanaoweza kusoma kumbukumbu za ukaguzi.'],
  'Only officers can see the trial balance.': ['Abakulembeze bokka be basobola okulaba trial balance.', 'Ni viongozi tu wanaoweza kuona trial balance.'],
  'Only officers can verify the audit trail.': ['Abakulembeze bokka be basobola okukakasa ebiwandiiko by\'okukebera.', 'Ni viongozi tu wanaoweza kuthibitisha kumbukumbu za ukaguzi.'],
  'Only owners can change the team.': ['Bannannyini bokka be basobola okukyusa ttiimu.', 'Wamiliki pekee wanaweza kubadilisha timu.'],
  'Only shares or savings can be for a goal.': ['Emigabo oba okutereka byokka bye bisobola okuba eby\'ekigendererwa.', 'Ni hisa au akiba tu zinazoweza kuwa za lengo.'],
  'Only some words are translated so far. The rest stay in English.': ['Ebigambo ebimu byokka bye bivvuunuddwa okutuusa kati. Ebirala bisigala mu Lungereza.', 'Ni baadhi ya maneno tu yametafsiriwa hadi sasa. Mengine yanabaki kwa Kiingereza.'],
  'Only the admin or loan officer. Shown to the committee and kept in the audit trail.': ['Omukulembeze oba avunaanyizibwa ku mabanja yekka. Kiragibwa akakiiko era kikuumibwa mu biwandiiko by\'okukebera.', 'Msimamizi au afisa wa mikopo pekee. Huonyeshwa kwa kamati na kuhifadhiwa kwenye kumbukumbu za ukaguzi.'],
  'Only the admin or the secretary can ask for a password reset.': ['Omukulembeze oba omuwandiisi bokka be basobola okusaba okukyusa password.', 'Ni msimamizi au katibu tu anayeweza kuomba kubadilisha nenosiri.'],
  'Only the circle admin can invite someone as an officer.': ['Omukulembeze w\'ekibiina yekka y\'asobola okuyita omuntu okuba omukulembeze.', 'Ni msimamizi wa kikundi tu anayeweza kumwalika mtu kuwa kiongozi.'],
  'Only the group admin or loan officer can change the rules for one loan.': ['Omukulembeze w\'ekibiina oba avunaanyizibwa ku mabanja bokka be basobola okukyusa amateeka g\'ebbanja erimu.', 'Ni msimamizi wa kikundi au kiongozi wa mikopo tu anayeweza kubadilisha kanuni za mkopo mmoja.'],
  'Only the group admin or treasurer can connect a payment gateway.': ['Omukulembeze w\'ekibiina oba omuwanika bokka be basobola okuyunga engeri y\'okusasula ku mutimbagano.', 'Ni msimamizi wa kikundi au mweka hazina tu anayeweza kuunganisha njia ya malipo ya mtandaoni.'],
  'Only the organization admin can change roles.': ['Omukulembeze w\'ekitongole yekka y\'asobola okukyusa ebifo.', 'Ni msimamizi wa shirika tu anayeweza kubadilisha nafasi.'],
  'Only the organization admin can give officer roles.': ['Omukulembeze w\'ekitongole yekka y\'asobola okuwa ebifo by\'obukulembeze.', 'Ni msimamizi wa shirika tu anayeweza kutoa nafasi za uongozi.'],
  'Only the person who sent it, or the circle admin, can cancel it.': ['Eyakuweereza yekka, oba omukulembeze w\'ekibiina, y\'asobola okukusazaamu.', 'Ni aliyeutuma tu, au msimamizi wa kikundi, anayeweza kuufuta.'],
  'Only the platform owner can change administrators.': ['Nnannyini platform yekka y\'asobola okukyusa abakulembeze.', 'Ni mmiliki wa mfumo tu anayeweza kubadilisha wasimamizi.'],
  'Only the treasurer or admin can record money going out.': ['Omuwanika oba omukulembeze bokka be basobola okuwandiika ssente ezifuluma.', 'Ni mweka hazina au msimamizi tu anayeweza kurekodi pesa zinazotoka.'],
  'Only this circle\'s admin can change {0}': ['Omukulembeze w\'ekibiina kino yekka y\'asobola okukyusa {0}', 'Msimamizi wa kikundi hiki pekee anaweza kubadilisha {0}'],
  'Only this circle\'s admin or secretary can invite people.': ['Omukulembeze oba omuwandiisi w\'ekibiina kino bokka be basobola okuyita abantu.', 'Ni msimamizi au katibu wa kikundi hiki tu anayeweza kualika watu.'],
  'Only this circle\'s admin or secretary can see its invitations.': ['Omukulembeze oba omuwandiisi w\'ekibiina kino bokka be basobola okulaba okuyitibwa kwakyo.', 'Ni msimamizi au katibu wa kikundi hiki tu anayeweza kuona mialiko yake.'],
  'Only this circle\'s officers can see this.': ['Abakulembeze b\'ekibiina kino bokka be basobola okulaba kino.', 'Ni viongozi wa kikundi hiki tu wanaoweza kuona hili.'],
