  'Reported to apply above UGX 1.5bn voluntary savings and UGX 500m institutional capital. The SACCO union disputes this in court, so ask a lawyer if you are near these sizes.': ['Kigambibwa okukola ng\'ossusse UGX 1.5bn ez\'okutereka okw\'obwannakyewa ne UGX 500m ez\'entandikwa y\'ekitongole. Omukago gwa SACCO gukiwakanya mu kkooti, n\'olwekyo buuza munnamateeka bw\'oba onootera okutuuka awo.', 'Inaripotiwa kutumika juu ya akiba ya hiari ya UGX 1.5bn na mtaji wa taasisi wa UGX 500m. Muungano wa SACCO unapinga hili mahakamani, kwa hiyo muulize wakili ukikaribia viwango hivi.'],
