  'SACCO Ledger': ['Ekitabo kya SACCO', 'Daftari la SACCO'],
  'SACCO Ledger keeps records of your group\'s transactions: your name, phone, and what you paid or borrowed. Your group officers can see them. We never hold your money. Records are kept so your group can prove what happened. They are stored on secure cloud servers that may be outside Uganda, and by ticking you agree to this. You can ask your group to show or correct your records.': ['SACCO Ledger ekuuma ebiwandiiko by\'ebikolebwa mu kibiina kyo: erinnya lyo, essimu, ne bye wasasula oba bye weewola. Abakulembeze b\'ekibiina kyo basobola okubiraba. Tetukwata ssente zo n\'akatono. Ebiwandiiko bikuumibwa ekibiina kyo kisobole okukakasa ekyaliwo. Biterekebwa ku kompyuta ez\'obukuumi ez\'oku yintaneeti eziyinza okuba ebweru wa Uganda, era bw\'oteekako akabonero oba okkirizza kino. Osobola okusaba ekibiina kyo okukulaga oba okutereeza ebiwandiiko byo.', 'SACCO Ledger huweka rekodi za miamala ya kikundi chako: jina lako, simu, na ulicholipa au kukopa. Viongozi wa kikundi chako wanaweza kuziona. Hatushiki pesa zako kamwe. Rekodi huwekwa ili kikundi chako kiweze kuthibitisha kilichotokea. Huhifadhiwa kwenye seva salama za mtandaoni ambazo zinaweza kuwa nje ya Uganda, na kwa kuweka tiki unakubali hili. Unaweza kuomba kikundi chako kikuonyeshe au kirekebishe rekodi zako.'],
  'SACCO Ledger keeps records only. It does not hold or move money.': ['SACCO Ledger ekuuma biwandiiko byokka. Tekwata wadde okutambuza ssente.', 'SACCO Ledger huweka rekodi tu. Haishiki wala kuhamisha pesa.'],
  'SMS sender ID': ['ID y\'aweereza SMS', 'ID ya mtumaji wa SMS'],
