  'Saved': ['Kiterekeddwa', 'Imehifadhiwa'],
  'Saved on your account, so it follows you to any phone.': ['Kiterekeddwa ku akawunti yo, n\'olwekyo kikugoberera ku ssimu yonna.', 'Imehifadhiwa kwenye akaunti yako, hivyo inakufuata kwenye simu yoyote.'],
  'Saved {0}': ['Kiterekeddwa {0}', 'Imehifadhiwa {0}'],
  'Saved.': ['Kiterekeddwa.', 'Imehifadhiwa.'],
  'Savings': ['Ssente ezitereke', 'Akiba'],
  'Savings at the end of each month. Now {0}{1}': ['Ssente ezitereke ku nkomerero ya buli mwezi. Kati {0}{1}', 'Akiba mwishoni mwa kila mwezi. Sasa {0}{1}'],
  'Savings deposit': ['Okutereka ssente', 'Kuweka akiba'],
  'Savings groups register at the district, a lighter route than a licence. Ask your district office for the form.': ['Ebibiina by\'okutereka byewandiisa ku disitulikiti, ekkubo eryangu okusinga layisinsi. Saba foomu ku ofiisi ya disitulikiti yo.', 'Vikundi vya akiba hujisajili wilayani, njia rahisi kuliko leseni. Omba fomu kwenye ofisi ya wilaya yako.'],
  'Savings withdrawal': ['Okuggyayo ssente ezitereke', 'Kutoa akiba'],
  'Savings {0}': ['Ssente ezitereke {0}', 'Akiba {0}'],
  'Savings {0}. Limit {1}': ['Ssente ezitereke {0}. Ekkomo {1}', 'Akiba {0}. Kikomo {1}'],
