  'See and join': ['Laba era oyingire', 'Ona na ujiunge'],
  'See the numbers': ['Laba emiwendo', 'Ona namba'],
  'Self-help group (VSLA) registration': ['Okuwandiisa ekibiina ky\'okweyamba (VSLA)', 'Usajili wa kikundi cha kujisaidia (VSLA)'],
  'Send Claim': ['Weereza Okusaba', 'Tuma Dai'],
  'Send request': ['Weereza okusaba', 'Tuma ombi'],
  'Send reset link': ['Weereza linki y\'okukyusa', 'Tuma kiungo cha kuweka upya'],
  'Send the link again': ['Ddamu oweereze linki', 'Tuma kiungo tena'],
  'Send the money to your group with mobile money, as you always do.': ['Weereza ssente eri ekibiina kyo ne mobile money, nga bulijjo.', 'Tuma pesa kwa kikundi chako kwa mobile money, kama kawaida yako.'],
  'Send this to {0}': ['Weereza kino eri {0}', 'Tuma hii kwa {0}'],
  'Sent again to {0}. It can take a minute. Check Spam too.': ['Kiweerezeddwa nate eri {0}. Kiyinza okutwala eddakiika. Kebera ne mu Spam.', 'Imetumwa tena kwa {0}. Inaweza kuchukua dakika moja. Angalia Spam pia.'],
  'Sent back. Tap to see why': ['Kikomezeddwawo. Nyiga olabe lwaki', 'Imerudishwa. Gusa uone kwa nini'],
  'Sep': ['Seb', 'Sep'],
  'Separate welfare pot and relief claims': ['Ensawo y\'obuyambi ey\'enjawulo n\'okusaba obuyambi', 'Mfuko tofauti wa ustawi na madai ya msaada'],
  'Sets the phone code. Money stays in {0}.': ['Kiteekawo koodi y\'essimu. Ssente zisigala mu {0}.', 'Huweka msimbo wa simu. Pesa hubaki katika {0}.'],
  'Share': ['Gabana', 'Shiriki'],
  'Share price ({0})': ['Ebbeeyi y\'omugabo ({0})', 'Bei ya hisa ({0})'],
  'Share price, loan limit, interest, quorum': ['Ebbeeyi y\'omugabo, ekkomo ly\'ebbanja, amagoba, omuwendo ogumala', 'Bei ya hisa, kikomo cha mkopo, riba, akidi'],
  'Share-Out': ['Okugabana Ssente', 'Mgawanyo'],
  'Share-out': ['Okugabana ssente', 'Mgawanyo'],
  'Share-out check failed: {0} vs {1}. Nothing was posted.': ['Okukebera okugabana ssente kugaanyi: {0} ku {1}. Tewali kiwandiikiddwa.', 'Ukaguzi wa mgawanyo umeshindwa: {0} dhidi ya {1}. Hakuna kilichorekodiwa.'],
  'Shared across every payment': ['Kigabanyizibwa mu buli kusasula', 'Hugawanywa katika kila malipo'],
  'Shares': ['Emigabo', 'Hisa'],
  'Shares and deposits': ['Emigabo n\'essente eziterekeddwa', 'Hisa na amana'],
  'Shares {0}, pot {1}. Do not close. Tell the platform team.': ['Emigabo {0}, ensawo {1}. Toggalawo. Tegeeza ttiimu ya pulatifomu.', 'Hisa {0}, mfuko {1}. Usifunge. Iambie timu ya jukwaa.'],
  'Show all {0}': ['Laga byonna {0}', 'Onyesha zote {0}'],
  'Show fewer': ['Laga bitono', 'Onyesha chache'],
  'Show me around the app': ['Ndaga app bw\'ekola', 'Nionyeshe programu'],
  'Show password': ['Laga paasiwaadi', 'Onyesha nenosiri'],
  'Show passwords': ['Laga paasiwaadi zonna', 'Onyesha manenosiri'],
  'Show the welcome tour again': ['Ddamu olage okulambula app', 'Onyesha ziara ya kukaribisha tena'],
  'Shown on your account. Small photos only.': ['Kirabika ku akawunti yo. Ebifaananyi ebitono byokka.', 'Huonekana kwenye akaunti yako. Picha ndogo tu.'],
  'Sign in': ['Yingira', 'Ingia'],
  'Sign out': ['Fuluma', 'Toka'],
  'Sign out everywhere': ['Fuluma buli wamu', 'Toka kila mahali'],
  'Sign out of all devices': ['Fuluma ku ssimu zonna', 'Toka kwenye vifaa vyote'],
  'Sign out of all devices?': ['Ofulume ku ssimu zonna?', 'Utoke kwenye vifaa vyote?'],
  'Signs in with {0}': ['Ayingira ne {0}', 'Huingia kwa {0}'],
  'Simple rules from your numbers. The app never acts on money.': ['Amateeka amangu okuva mu miwendo gyo. App tekwata ku ssente.', 'Kanuni rahisi kutoka kwa namba zako. Programu haigusi pesa kamwe.'],
  'Skip': ['Buuka', 'Ruka'],
  'Small': ['Ntono', 'Ndogo'],
  'Small buttons next to words like share-out and ledger.': ['Obupeesa obutono okumpi n\'ebigambo nga okugabana ssente n\'ekitabo.', 'Vitufe vidogo kando ya maneno kama mgawanyo na leja.'],
  'Smaller payments, each month': ['Okusasula okutono, buli mwezi', 'Malipo madogo, kila mwezi'],
  'Someone else must decide your own claim. (Two people rule)': ['Omuntu omulala y\'alina okusalawo ku kusaba kwo. (Etteeka ly\'abantu babiri)', 'Mtu mwingine lazima aamue dai lako mwenyewe. (Kanuni ya watu wawili)'],
  'Someone else must forgive your own late fees. (Two people rule)': ['Omuntu omulala y\'alina okukusonyiwa engassi zo ez\'okulwawo. (Etteeka ly\'abantu babiri)', 'Mtu mwingine lazima akusamehe faini zako za kuchelewa. (Kanuni ya watu wawili)'],
  'Someone else must review this: it is your own money. (Two people rule)': ['Omuntu omulala y\'alina okukebera kino: ze ssente zo. (Etteeka ly\'abantu babiri)', 'Mtu mwingine lazima akague hili: ni pesa zako mwenyewe. (Kanuni ya watu wawili)'],
  'Someone else must review this: you submitted it. (Two people rule)': ['Omuntu omulala y\'alina okukebera kino: ggwe wakiweereza. (Etteeka ly\'abantu babiri)', 'Mtu mwingine lazima akague hili: wewe ndiye uliyelituma. (Kanuni ya watu wawili)'],
  'Start': ['Tandika', 'Anza'],
  'Start a new circle': ['Tandika ekibiina ekipya', 'Anzisha kikundi kipya'],
  'Start a new group': ['Tandika ekibiina ekipya', 'Anzisha kikundi kipya'],
  'Statement': ['Sitetimenti', 'Taarifa ya akaunti'],
  'Statements': ['Sitetimenti', 'Taarifa za akaunti'],
  'Still owed on loans': ['Ekikyabanjibwa ku mabanja', 'Kinachodaiwa bado kwenye mikopo'],
  'Stop others using your account on a shared or lost phone.': ['Ziyiza abalala okukozesa akawunti yo ku ssimu egabanibwa oba ebuze.', 'Zuia wengine kutumia akaunti yako kwenye simu ya pamoja au iliyopotea.'],
  'Store policies': ['Amateeka ga sitoowa za app', 'Sera za maduka ya programu'],
  'Stores can ask a finance app for proof of who you are and what you do. Keep the opinion and registrations ready.': ['Sitoowa za app ziyinza okusaba app y\'ebyensimbi obukakafu bw\'oli ani ne ky\'okola. Tegeka ebbaluwa ya munnamateeka n\'ebiwandiiko by\'okwewandiisa.', 'Maduka ya programu yanaweza kuomba programu ya fedha uthibitisho wa wewe ni nani na unafanya nini. Weka tayari maoni ya wakili na usajili.'],
  'Substandard': ['Wansi w\'omutindo', 'Chini ya kiwango'],
  'Switch circle': ['Kyusa ekibiina', 'Badilisha kikundi'],
  'Switch off': ['Ggyako', 'Zima'],
  'TEST MONEY': ['SSENTE ZA KUGEZESA', 'PESA ZA MAJARIBIO'],
  'TEST money': ['Ssente za KUGEZESA', 'Pesa za MAJARIBIO'],
  'Tap Pay, then Record a Payment. Type the amount and the ID.': ['Nyiga Sasula, oluvannyuma Wandiika Okusasula. Wandiika omuwendo ne ID.', 'Gusa Lipa, kisha Rekodi Malipo. Andika kiasi na ID.'],
  'Tap to see it and join: {0}  (or open the app, tap My circles, Join with a code: {1}': ['Nyiga okukiraba n\'okwegatta: {0}  (oba ggulawo app, nyiga Ebibiina byange, Weegatte ne koodi: {1}', 'Gusa ili kuona na kujiunga: {0}  (au fungua programu, gusa Vikundi vyangu, Jiunge kwa msimbo: {1}'],
  'Team or block': ['Ttiimu oba okuziyiza', 'Timu au kuzuia'],
  'Term (Months)': ['Ebbanga (Emyezi)', 'Muda (Miezi)'],
  'Term must be 1 to 60 months.': ['Ebbanga lirina okuba emyezi 1 okutuuka ku 60.', 'Muda lazima uwe miezi 1 hadi 60.'],
  'Term must be at least 1 month.': ['Ebbanga lirina okuba omwezi 1 oba okusingawo.', 'Muda lazima uwe angalau mwezi 1.'],
  'Test and save': ['Gezesa otereke', 'Jaribu na uhifadhi'],
  'Test keys work only in a demo group. Use live keys for a real group.': ['Test keys zikola mu kibiina eky\'okugezesa kyokka. Kozesa live keys ku kibiina ekituufu.', 'Test keys zinafanya kazi kwenye kikundi cha majaribio tu. Tumia live keys kwa kikundi halisi.'],
  'Test: pretend money (demo group only)': ['Kugezesa: ssente ezitali za ddala (ekibiina kya demo kyokka)', 'Jaribio: pesa zisizo halisi (kikundi cha demo tu)'],
  'Text size': ['Obunene bw\'ennukuta', 'Ukubwa wa maandishi'],
  'That code is not right. After 5 tries it stops working.': ['Koodi eyo si ntuufu. Bw\'ogezaako emirundi 5 erekera awo okukola.', 'Msimbo huo si sahihi. Baada ya majaribio 5 unaacha kufanya kazi.'],
  'That file is not a photo we can read.': ['Fayiro eyo si kifaananyi kye tusobola okusoma.', 'Faili hiyo si picha tunayoweza kusoma.'],
  'That goal is not open in this group.': ['Ekigendererwa ekyo si kiggule mu kibiina kino.', 'Lengo hilo haliko wazi kwenye kikundi hiki.'],
  'That is a lot of invitations for one day. Try again tomorrow.': ['Okuyitibwa okwo kungi nnyo ku lunaku lumu. Ddamu ogezeeko enkya.', 'Hiyo ni mialiko mingi kwa siku moja. Jaribu tena kesho.'],
  'That member is not active in this group.': ['Mmemba oyo takola mu kibiina kino.', 'Mwanachama huyo si hai kwenye kikundi hiki.'],
  'That phone looks wrong. Write it like {0}, or leave it empty.': ['Ennamba y\'essimu eyo erabika nkyamu. Giwandiike nga {0}, oba gireke nga njereere.', 'Namba hiyo ya simu inaonekana si sahihi. Iandike kama {0}, au iache wazi.'],
  'The PIN lives only on this phone.': ['PIN ebeera ku ssimu eno yokka.', 'PIN inakaa kwenye simu hii tu.'],
  'The PIN still works too.': ['PIN nayo ekyakola.', 'PIN bado inafanya kazi pia.'],
  'The app only writes things down. It never holds your money.': ['App ewandiika buwandiisi. Tekwata ssente zo n\'akatono.', 'Programu huandika tu. Haishiki pesa zako kamwe.'],
  'The app stores names, phones and money records, so register online with PDPO, renew every year, name a data protection officer, and keep a record of why data may sit outside Uganda. Do this first.': ['App etereka amannya, essimu n\'ebiwandiiko by\'essente, kale weewandiise ku mutimbagano ne PDPO, ozze buggya buli mwaka, olonde omukungu akuuma data, era okuume ekiwandiiko ekinnyonnyola lwaki data eyinza okubeera ebweru wa Uganda. Kino kisooke.', 'Programu huhifadhi majina, simu na rekodi za pesa, kwa hiyo jisajili mtandaoni kwa PDPO, sajili upya kila mwaka, teua afisa wa ulinzi wa data, na uweke rekodi ya kwa nini data inaweza kukaa nje ya Uganda. Fanya hili kwanza.'],
  'The circle\'s admin did not agree to this invitation.': ['Omukulembeze w\'ekibiina teyakkiriza kuyitibwa kuno.', 'Msimamizi wa kikundi hakukubali mwaliko huu.'],
  'The circle\'s admin must agree first. Until they do, the link and code do not work. Then it works for 14 days, only for {0}': ['Omukulembeze w\'ekibiina alina okusooka okukkiriza. Nga tannakkiriza, linki ne koodi tebikola. Oluvannyuma bikola ennaku 14, eri ono yekka: {0}', 'Msimamizi wa kikundi lazima akubali kwanza. Kabla hajakubali, kiungo na msimbo havifanyi kazi. Kisha hufanya kazi kwa siku 14, kwa huyu tu: {0}'],
  'The code has 8 letters and numbers.': ['Koodi erina ennukuta n\'ennamba 8.', 'Msimbo una herufi na namba 8.'],
  'The demo is open to everyone already.': ['Ekibiina eky\'okugezesa kiggule dda eri buli muntu.', 'Kikundi cha majaribio tayari kiko wazi kwa kila mtu.'],
  'The emergency fund ({0}': ['Ensawo y\'obuyambi ({0}', 'Mfuko wa dharura ({0}'],
  'The emergency fund does not have this much.': ['Ensawo y\'obuyambi terina ssente zenkana awo.', 'Mfuko wa dharura hauna kiasi hiki.'],
  'The founder always stays owner.': ['Omutandisi asigala nga ye nnannyini bulijjo.', 'Mwanzilishi hubaki mmiliki daima.'],
  'The founder cannot be blocked.': ['Omutandisi tasobola kuziyizibwa.', 'Mwanzilishi hawezi kuzuiwa.'],
  'The founder cannot be removed.': ['Omutandisi tasobola kuggyibwamu.', 'Mwanzilishi hawezi kuondolewa.'],
  'The full loan': ['Ebbanja lyonna', 'Mkopo wote'],
  'The group holds': ['Ekibiina kirina', 'Kikundi kina'],
  'The group\'s money book. Every shilling in or out is written here once and can never be edited or deleted. Mistakes are fixed with a new, visible correction.': ['Ekitabo ky\'essente z\'ekibiina. Buli ssiringi eyingira oba efuluma ewandiikibwa wano omulundi gumu era tekyusibwa wadde okusangulibwa. Ensobi zitereezebwa n\'okutereeza okupya okulabika.', 'Kitabu cha pesa za kikundi. Kila shilingi inayoingia au kutoka huandikwa hapa mara moja na haiwezi kubadilishwa wala kufutwa. Makosa hurekebishwa kwa sahihisho jipya linaloonekana.'],
  'The group\'s own accounts': ['Akawunti z\'ekibiina zennyini', 'Akaunti za kikundi chenyewe'],
  'The invitation goes away. If you change your mind, ask them for a new one.': ['Okuyitibwa kuggwaawo. Bw\'okyusa ekirowoozo, basabe okukuyita okupya.', 'Mwaliko unaondoka. Ukibadili nia, waombe mwaliko mpya.'],
  'The meeting closes only if the counted cash equals the ledger cash.': ['Olukiiko luggalwa kasita ssente ezibaliddwa zenkana n\'eziri mu kitabo.', 'Mkutano hufungwa tu ikiwa pesa zilizohesabiwa ni sawa na pesa za leja.'],
  'The most a member can borrow, as times their savings. With 3, someone with 100,000 saved can borrow up to 300,000.': ['Ekisinga mmemba ky\'asobola okwewola, ng\'emirundi gy\'essente z\'aterese. Ku 3, aterese 100,000 asobola okwewola okutuuka ku 300,000.', 'Kiwango cha juu mwanachama anaweza kukopa, kama mara za akiba yake. Kwa 3, mwenye akiba ya 100,000 anaweza kukopa hadi 300,000.'],
  'The number your group gets from MTN, Airtel or M-Pesa to receive payments. Members pay it directly. The app never holds the money.': ['Ennamba ekibiina kyammwe gye kifuna okuva mu MTN, Airtel oba M-Pesa okufuna ssente. Bammemba bagisasulako butereevu. App tekwata ssente n\'akatono.', 'Namba ambayo kikundi chenu hupata kutoka MTN, Airtel au M-Pesa ili kupokea malipo. Wanachama hulipa moja kwa moja. Programu haishiki pesa kamwe.'],
  'The owner cannot be removed.': ['Nnannyini tasobola kuggyibwamu.', 'Mmiliki hawezi kuondolewa.'],
  'The payment company tells our server it was paid, then our server asks them again. Only then does it enter the books. Nobody types the transaction ID.': ['Kkampuni y\'okusasula etegeeza sava yaffe nti kisasuddwa, olwo sava yaffe n\'eddamu okugibuuza. Olwo lwokka lwe kiyingira mu bitabo. Tewali awandiika ID y\'okusasula.', 'Kampuni ya malipo huiambia seva yetu kuwa imelipwa, kisha seva yetu huwauliza tena. Hapo tu ndipo huingia kwenye vitabu. Hakuna anayeandika ID ya muamala.'],
  'The person who approved cannot also pay out. (Two people rule)': ['Eyakkiriza tasobola ate kuwa ssente. (Etteeka ly\'abantu babiri)', 'Aliyeidhinisha hawezi pia kutoa pesa. (Kanuni ya watu wawili)'],
  'The platform team asks to invite {0}': ['Ttiimu ya pulatifomu esaba okuyita {0}', 'Timu ya jukwaa inaomba kumwalika {0}'],
  'The platform team can look at this circle until {0}': ['Ttiimu ya pulatifomu esobola okulaba ekibiina kino okutuusa {0}', 'Timu ya jukwaa inaweza kuangalia kikundi hiki hadi {0}'],
  'The same amount each time': ['Omuwendo gwe gumu buli mulundi', 'Kiasi kilekile kila mara'],
  'The shared demo cannot take invitations. Invite people to a real circle.': ['Ekibiina eky\'okugezesa ekya bonna tekikkiriza kuyitibwa. Yita abantu mu kibiina ekituufu.', 'Kikundi cha majaribio cha wote hakipokei mialiko. Alika watu kwenye kikundi halisi.'],
  'The shares do not add up': ['Emigabo tegituuka ku mugatte', 'Jumla ya hisa hailingani'],
  'The things you do most are here. To pay: pay your group\'s own account first, then record it. A second person checks it.': ['Ebintu by\'osinga okukola biri wano. Okusasula: sooka osasule ku akawunti y\'ekibiina kyo, oluvannyuma okiwandiike. Omuntu owookubiri akikebera.', 'Mambo unayofanya zaidi yako hapa. Kulipa: lipa kwanza kwenye akaunti ya kikundi chako, kisha rekodi. Mtu wa pili hukagua.'],
  'The treasurer checks it. You see a green tick.': ['Omuwanika akikebera. Olaba akabonero aka kiragala.', 'Mweka hazina hukagua. Unaona alama ya kijani.'],
  'The two PINs are different.': ['PIN ebbiri tezifaanagana.', 'PIN mbili hazifanani.'],
  'The two new passwords are different.': ['Paasiwaadi empya ebbiri tezifaanagana.', 'Manenosiri mawili mapya hayafanani.'],
  'The two passwords are different.': ['Paasiwaadi ebbiri tezifaanagana.', 'Manenosiri mawili hayafanani.'],
  'Their email': ['Email ye', 'Barua pepe yake'],
  'Their role': ['Ekifo kye', 'Jukumu lake'],
  'Then pay {0} instead of {1} for that payment.': ['Olwo sasula {0} mu kifo kya {1} ku kusasula okwo.', 'Kisha lipa {0} badala ya {1} kwa malipo hayo.'],
  'There is nothing to share out.': ['Tewali kya kugabana.', 'Hakuna cha kugawana.'],
  'These buttons take you to the main pages. "More" opens everything else.': ['Obupeesa buno bukutwala ku miko emikulu. "Ebirala" kiggulawo ebisigadde byonna.', 'Vitufe hivi vinakupeleka kwenye kurasa kuu. "Zaidi" hufungua mengine yote.'],
  'They already have an account, so the invitation also waits in their app under My circles.': ['Alina dda akawunti, kale okuyitibwa nakwo kumulinze mu app ye wansi wa Ebibiina byange.', 'Tayari ana akaunti, kwa hiyo mwaliko pia unamsubiri kwenye programu yake chini ya Vikundi vyangu.'],
  'They are signed out everywhere and cannot sign in again. Nothing is deleted: group records stay whole. You can unblock later.': ['Afulumiziddwa buli wamu era tasobola kuddamu kuyingira. Tewali kisanguddwa: ebiwandiiko by\'ekibiina bisigala nga bijjuvu. Osobola okumuggyako okuziyizibwa oluvannyuma.', 'Ametolewa kila mahali na hawezi kuingia tena. Hakuna kinachofutwa: rekodi za kikundi zinabaki kamili. Unaweza kumwondolea kizuizi baadaye.'],
  'They get a link and a code. Nobody joins without saying yes.': ['Afuna linki ne koodi. Tewali ayingira nga takkirizza.', 'Anapata kiungo na msimbo. Hakuna anayejiunga bila kukubali.'],
  'They have no account yet. When they sign up with this email, the invitation will be waiting.': ['Tannaba na akawunti. Bw\'aneewandiisa ne email eno, okuyitibwa kujja kuba kumulinze.', 'Bado hana akaunti. Akijisajili kwa barua pepe hii, mwaliko utakuwa unamsubiri.'],
  'They lose platform access at once. Their own account and groups stay.': ['Aggyibwako obuyinza ku pulatifomu amangu ago. Akawunti ye n\'ebibiina bye bisigala.', 'Anapoteza ruhusa ya jukwaa mara moja. Akaunti yake na vikundi vyake vinabaki.'],
  'Things waiting for you show up here. Tap one to go straight to it. When it says All done, you can relax.': ['Ebikulinze birabika wano. Nyiga ekimu okukigendako butereevu. Bwe kigamba Byonna biwedde, osobola okuwummula.', 'Mambo yanayokusubiri huonekana hapa. Gusa moja kwenda moja kwa moja. Ikisema Yote tayari, unaweza kupumzika.'],
  'This account signs in with email. Tap "Forgot password?" and use the link we send to your email.': ['Akawunti eno eyingira na email. Nyiga "Forgot password?" okozese link gye tukuweereza ku email yo.', 'Akaunti hii huingia kwa email. Bonyeza "Forgot password?" kisha tumia kiungo tunachotuma kwenye email yako.'],
  'This circle has not opened a support window.': ['Ekibiina kino tekinnaggulawo kiseera kya buyambi.', 'Kikundi hiki hakijafungua muda wa msaada.'],
  'This claim was already decided.': ['Okusaba kuno kwasalibwawo dda.', 'Dai hili tayari limeamuliwa.'],
  'This code is wrong or has expired.': ['Koodi eno nkyamu oba eweddeko.', 'Msimbo huu si sahihi au muda wake umeisha.'],
  'This code is wrong or has expired. Ask for a new one.': ['Koodi eno nkyamu oba eweddeko. Saba endala.', 'Msimbo huu si sahihi au muda wake umeisha. Omba mpya.'],
  'This code is wrong or has expired. Ask your group secretary for a new one.': ['Koodi eno nkyamu oba eweddeko. Saba omuwandiisi w\'ekibiina kyo endala.', 'Msimbo huu si sahihi au muda wake umeisha. Mwombe katibu wa kikundi chako mpya.'],
  'This does not change the phone you sign in with.': ['Kino tekikyusa ssimu gy\'oyingira nayo.', 'Hii haibadilishi simu unayoingia nayo.'],
  'This goal is not open.': ['Ekigendererwa kino si kiggule.', 'Lengo hili haliko wazi.'],
  'This invitation has expired. Ask for a new one.': ['Okuyitibwa kuno kuweddeko. Saba okulala.', 'Mwaliko huu umeisha muda. Omba mpya.'],
  'This invitation is not open.': ['Okuyitibwa kuno si kuggule.', 'Mwaliko huu hauko wazi.'],
  'This invitation is not waiting for a decision.': ['Okuyitibwa kuno tekulinze kusalibwawo.', 'Mwaliko huu hausubiri uamuzi.'],
  'This invitation is waiting for the circle\'s admin to agree. Try again later.': ['Okuyitibwa kuno kulinze omukulembeze w\'ekibiina okukkiriza. Ddamu ogezeeko oluvannyuma.', 'Mwaliko huu unasubiri msimamizi wa kikundi akubali. Jaribu tena baadaye.'],
  'This invitation was already used.': ['Okuyitibwa kuno kwakozesebwa dda.', 'Mwaliko huu tayari umetumika.'],
  'This invitation was cancelled. Ask for a new one.': ['Okuyitibwa kuno kwasazibwamu. Saba okulala.', 'Mwaliko huu umefutwa. Omba mpya.'],
  'This invitation was sent to {0}. Sign in with that account to open it.': ['Okuyitibwa kuno kwaweerezebwa {0}. Yingira ne akawunti eyo okukuggulawo.', 'Mwaliko huu ulitumwa kwa {0}. Ingia kwa akaunti hiyo ili kuufungua.'],
  'This invitation was turned down. Ask for a new one.': ['Okuyitibwa kuno kwagaanibwa. Saba okulala.', 'Mwaliko huu ulikataliwa. Omba mpya.'],
  'This is a guide, not legal advice. SACCO Ledger does not hold any licence on your behalf, and using this app is not a licence. Ask a Ugandan lawyer to confirm what applies before going live. Fees and rules change: check with each regulator.': ['Kino kya kulagirira, si magezi ga mateeka. SACCO Ledger terina layisinsi yonna ku lulwo, era okukozesa app eno si layisinsi. Saba munnamateeka wa Uganda akakase ebikukwatako nga tonnatandika. Ebisale n\'amateeka bikyuka: buuza buli kitongole ekirondoola.', 'Huu ni mwongozo, si ushauri wa kisheria. SACCO Ledger haina leseni yoyote kwa niaba yako, na kutumia programu hii si leseni. Muombe wakili wa Uganda athibitishe kinachokuhusu kabla ya kuanza. Ada na sheria hubadilika: uliza kila mdhibiti.'],
  'This is another circle inside SACCO Ledger. Joining adds it next to your other circles. Nothing in them changes, and their money never mixes. Switch between circles any time from the top bar or My circles.': ['Kino kibiina kirala munda mu SACCO Ledger. Okwegatta kukyongera ku bibiina byo ebirala. Tewali kikyuka mu byo, era ssente zaabyo tezeetabula. Kyusa ebibiina essaawa yonna okuva waggulu oba mu Ebibiina byange.', 'Hiki ni kikundi kingine ndani ya SACCO Ledger. Kujiunga kunakiongeza kando ya vikundi vyako vingine. Hakuna kinachobadilika ndani yavyo, na pesa zao hazichanganyiki kamwe. Badilisha vikundi wakati wowote kutoka upau wa juu au Vikundi vyangu.'],
  'This is the group you are in. Tap it to switch to another circle.': ['Kino kye kibiina ky\'olimu. Kinyige okukyusa ku kibiina ekirala.', 'Hiki ndicho kikundi ulichomo. Kiguse ili kwenda kikundi kingine.'],
  'This is the shared demo. Everyone can look around, nobody can change it. Start your own circle in My circles to try changes.': ['Eno ye demo ya bonna. Buli omu asobola okutunula, tewali asobola kugikyusa. Tandika ekibiina kyo mu Ebibiina byange okugezaako enkyukakyuka.', 'Hii ni demo ya wote. Kila mtu anaweza kuangalia, hakuna anayeweza kuibadilisha. Anzisha kikundi chako kwenye Vikundi vyangu ili kujaribu mabadiliko.'],
  'This journal was already reversed.': ['Journal eno yasazibwamu dda.', 'Journal hii tayari imebatilishwa.'],
  'This kind of journal cannot be reversed.': ['Journal ey\'ekika kino tesobola kusazibwamu.', 'Journal ya aina hii haiwezi kubatilishwa.'],
  'This loan cannot be rejected now.': ['Ebbanja lino terisobola kugaanibwa kaakano.', 'Mkopo huu hauwezi kukataliwa sasa.'],
  'This loan is not active.': ['Ebbanja lino terikola.', 'Mkopo huu si hai.'],
  'This loan is not approved yet.': ['Ebbanja lino terinnakkirizibwa.', 'Mkopo huu bado haujaidhinishwa.'],
  'This loan is not waiting for approval.': ['Ebbanja lino terilinze kukkirizibwa.', 'Mkopo huu hausubiri kuidhinishwa.'],
  'This meeting is not open.': ['Olukiiko luno si luggule.', 'Mkutano huu hauko wazi.'],
  'This member has an active loan. Clear it before withdrawing savings.': ['Mmemba ono alina ebbanja ly\'akyasasula. Sooka olimalewo nga tannaggyayo ssente z\'aterese.', 'Mwanachama huyu ana mkopo unaoendelea. Ulipe wote kabla ya kutoa akiba.'],
  'This member has no active loan.': ['Mmemba ono talina bbanja kati.', 'Mwanachama huyu hana mkopo unaoendelea.'],
  'This member has no savings yet.': ['Mmemba ono tannatereka ssente.', 'Mwanachama huyu bado hana akiba.'],
  'This person is already an administrator.': ['Omuntu ono mukulembeze dda.', 'Mtu huyu tayari ni msimamizi.'],
  'This person is already in this circle.': ['Omuntu ono ali dda mu kibiina kino.', 'Mtu huyu tayari yumo kwenye kikundi hiki.'],
  'This person is already on the team. Use Make owner or Make admin.': ['Omuntu ono ali dda ku ttiimu. Kozesa Mufuule nnannyini oba Mufuule mukulembeze.', 'Mtu huyu tayari yumo kwenye timu. Tumia Mfanye mmiliki au Mfanye msimamizi.'],
  'This person is not an administrator.': ['Omuntu ono si mukulembeze.', 'Mtu huyu si msimamizi.'],
  'This person is not on the team.': ['Omuntu ono tali ku ttiimu.', 'Mtu huyu hayumo kwenye timu.'],
  'This record is permanent. Post a reversal instead of changing it.': ['Ekiwandiiko kino tekikyusibwa. Wandiika ekikisazaamu mu kifo ky\'okukikyusa.', 'Rekodi hii ni ya kudumu. Weka ubatilishaji badala ya kuibadilisha.'],
  'This record was already reviewed.': ['Ekiwandiiko kino kyakeberebwa dda.', 'Rekodi hii tayari imekaguliwa.'],
  'This records paying out {0} and starts a new cycle. It cannot be reversed. Pay members from the group\'s own money. The app does not send it.': ['Kino kiwandiika okusasula {0} era kitandika ekiseera ekipya. Tekisobola kuzzibwa mabega. Sasula bammemba okuva mu ssente z\'ekibiina zennyini. App tezisindika.', 'Hii inarekodi kulipa {0} na kuanza mzunguko mpya. Haiwezi kurudishwa. Lipa wanachama kutoka pesa za kikundi chenyewe. Programu haizitumi.'],
  'This request is not pending.': ['Okusaba kuno tekulinze.', 'Ombi hili halisubiri.'],
  'This transaction ID was already recorded in this group.': ['Transaction ID eno yawandiikibwa dda mu kibiina kino.', 'Transaction ID hii tayari imerekodiwa kwenye kikundi hiki.'],
  'Tier 1': ['Omutendera 1', 'Daraja 1'],
  'Tier 2': ['Omutendera 2', 'Daraja 2'],
  'Tier 3': ['Omutendera 3', 'Daraja 3'],
