  'Total late fees: {0}': ['Omugatte gw\'engassi z\'okulwawo: {0}', 'Jumla ya faini za kuchelewa: {0}'],
  'Total: {0}': ['Omugatte: {0}', 'Jumla: {0}'],
  'Transaction ID from the SMS': ['ID y\'okusasula okuva mu SMS', 'ID ya muamala kutoka kwenye SMS'],
  'Treasurer': ['Omuwanika', 'Mweka hazina'],
  'Trial Balance': ['Bbalansi y\'okugezesa', 'Urari wa majaribio'],
  'Try numbers. Nothing is saved until you choose to.': ['Gezaako emiwendo. Tewali kiterekebwa okutuusa lw\'osalawo.', 'Jaribu namba. Hakuna kinachohifadhiwa hadi uamue.'],
  'Try other loan rules': ['Gezaako amateeka g\'amabanja amalala', 'Jaribu kanuni nyingine za mikopo'],
  'Turn it on now': ['Kiteekeko kati', 'Washa sasa'],
  'Turn off': ['Ggyako', 'Zima'],
  'Turn off two-step sign-in?': ['Oggyeko okuyingira mu mitendera ebiri?', 'Zima kuingia kwa hatua mbili?'],
  'Turn on': ['Teekako', 'Washa'],
  'Turn on two-step sign-in': ['Teekako okuyingira mu mitendera ebiri', 'Washa kuingia kwa hatua mbili'],
  'Turn on two-step sign-in to unlock platform tools': ['Teekako okuyingira mu mitendera ebiri okuggulawo ebikozesebwa bya pulatifomu', 'Washa kuingia kwa hatua mbili ili kufungua zana za jukwaa'],
  'Two different people must count the cash.': ['Abantu babiri ab\'enjawulo be balina okubala ssente.', 'Watu wawili tofauti lazima wahesabu pesa.'],
  'Two different people must count the closing cash.': ['Abantu babiri ab\'enjawulo be balina okubala ssente ez\'okuggalawo.', 'Watu wawili tofauti lazima wahesabu pesa za kufunga.'],
  'Two different witnesses are required.': ['Abajulizi babiri ab\'enjawulo beetaagibwa.', 'Mashahidi wawili tofauti wanahitajika.'],
  'Two of your group\'s officers must agree before a code is made.': ['Abakulembeze babiri ab\'ekibiina kyo balina okukkiriza nga koodi tennakolebwa.', 'Viongozi wawili wa kikundi chako lazima wakubali kabla msimbo haujatengenezwa.'],
  'Two-person check': ['Okukebera kw\'abantu babiri', 'Ukaguzi wa watu wawili'],
  'Two-step sign-in': ['Okuyingira mu mitendera ebiri', 'Kuingia kwa hatua mbili'],
  'Two-step sign-in is off.': ['Okuyingira mu mitendera ebiri kuggyiddwako.', 'Kuingia kwa hatua mbili kumezimwa.'],
  'Two-step sign-in is on. Keep your authenticator app: you need it to sign in.': ['Okuyingira mu mitendera ebiri kuliko. Kuuma app yo eya authenticator: ogyetaaga okuyingira.', 'Kuingia kwa hatua mbili kumewashwa. Tunza programu yako ya authenticator: unaihitaji ili kuingia.'],
  'Type': ['Ekika', 'Aina'],
  'Type (e.g. UMRA SACCO licence)': ['Ekika (okugeza layisinsi ya UMRA SACCO)', 'Aina (mfano leseni ya UMRA SACCO)'],
  'Type at least 2 letters.': ['Wandiika ennukuta 2 oba okusingawo.', 'Andika angalau herufi 2.'],
  'Type of group': ['Ekika ky\'ekibiina', 'Aina ya kikundi'],
  'Type part of an email or name to find people who already have an account.': ['Wandiika ekitundu kya email oba erinnya okuzuula abantu abalina dda akawunti.', 'Andika sehemu ya barua pepe au jina ili kupata watu ambao tayari wana akaunti.'],
  'Type the 6 numbers from the app.': ['Wandiika ennamba 6 okuva mu app.', 'Andika namba 6 kutoka kwenye programu.'],
  'Type the 6 numbers from your authenticator app.': ['Wandiika ennamba 6 okuva mu app yo eya authenticator.', 'Andika namba 6 kutoka kwenye programu yako ya authenticator.'],
  'Type the 8-letter code from your invitation or from the circle\'s secretary.': ['Wandiika koodi ey\'ennukuta 8 okuva mu kuyitibwa kwo oba ew\'omuwandiisi w\'ekibiina.', 'Andika msimbo wa herufi 8 kutoka kwenye mwaliko wako au kwa katibu wa kikundi.'],
  'Type your 4 to 6 number PIN.': ['Wandiika PIN yo ey\'ennamba 4 okutuuka ku 6.', 'Andika PIN yako ya namba 4 hadi 6.'],
  'Type your current password.': ['Wandiika paasiwaadi yo eriwo kati.', 'Andika nenosiri lako la sasa.'],
  'UCC rules; Data Protection Act': ['Amateeka ga UCC; Data Protection Act', 'Kanuni za UCC; Data Protection Act'],
  'UMRA SACCO licence': ['Layisinsi ya UMRA SACCO', 'Leseni ya UMRA SACCO'],
  'UMRA Self-Help Group Guidelines, under the Tier 4 Act': ['UMRA Self-Help Group Guidelines, wansi wa Tier 4 Act', 'UMRA Self-Help Group Guidelines, chini ya Tier 4 Act'],
  'URSB and URA': ['URSB ne URA', 'URSB na URA'],
  'Unblock': ['Ggyako okuziyiza', 'Ondoa kizuizi'],
  'Unknown country.': ['Ensi temanyiddwa.', 'Nchi haijulikani.'],
  'Unknown look.': ['Endabika temanyiddwa.', 'Mwonekano haujulikani.'],
  'Unlock': ['Ggulawo', 'Fungua'],
  'Unlock SACCO Ledger': ['Ggulawo SACCO Ledger', 'Fungua SACCO Ledger'],
  'Unlock with fingerprint or face': ['Ggulawo n\'ekinkumu oba amaaso', 'Fungua kwa alama ya kidole au uso'],
  'Update': ['Zza buggya', 'Sasisha'],
  'Use 4 to 6 numbers.': ['Kozesa ennamba 4 okutuuka ku 6.', 'Tumia namba 4 hadi 6.'],
  'Use a different account': ['Kozesa akawunti endala', 'Tumia akaunti nyingine'],
  'Use another email': ['Kozesa email endala', 'Tumia barua pepe nyingine'],
  'Use at least 8 characters.': ['Kozesa ennukuta 8 oba okusingawo.', 'Tumia angalau herufi 8.'],
  'Use the 8-letter code from your invitation or from your secretary.': ['Kozesa koodi ey\'ennukuta 8 okuva mu kuyitibwa kwo oba ew\'omuwandiisi wo.', 'Tumia msimbo wa herufi 8 kutoka kwenye mwaliko wako au kwa katibu wako.'],
  'VSLA meetings, attendance, quorum, shares, fines, emergency fund, cycle share-out': ['Enkiiko za VSLA, abazze, omuwendo ogwetaagisa, emigabo, engassi, ensawo y\'obuyambi, okugabana ssente kw\'ekiseera', 'Mikutano ya VSLA, mahudhurio, akidi, hisa, faini, mfuko wa dharura, mgawanyo wa mzunguko'],
  'Waiting for review ({0})': ['Birinze okukeberwa ({0})', 'Zinasubiri ukaguzi ({0})'],
  'Waiting for the circle admin to decide.': ['Tulinze omukulembeze w\'ekibiina asalewo.', 'Inasubiri msimamizi wa kikundi aamue.'],
  'Waiting for the treasurer to check': ['Kirinze omuwanika okukebera', 'Inasubiri mweka hazina akague'],
  'Watch': ['Okwegendereza', 'Angalizo'],
  'We meet on Saturdays at 10.': ['Tukuŋŋaana ku Lwomukaaga ku ssaawa 4 ez\'oku makya.', 'Tunakutana Jumamosi saa 4 asubuhi.'],
  'We never hold your money. We keep the records.': ['Tetukwata ssente zo n\'akatono. Tukuuma biwandiiko.', 'Hatushiki pesa zako kamwe. Tunatunza rekodi.'],
  'We sent a link to {0}. Click it to prove the email is yours, then sign in here. No email after a few minutes? Check Spam, or send it again.': ['Tuweerezza linki ku {0}. Ginyige okukakasa nti email yiyo, oluvannyuma oyingire wano. Tewali email oluvannyuma lw\'eddakiika ntono? Kebera mu Spam, oba ddamu ogiweereze.', 'Tumetuma kiungo kwa {0}. Kibofye ili kuthibitisha barua pepe ni yako, kisha ingia hapa. Hakuna barua pepe baada ya dakika chache? Angalia Spam, au tuma tena.'],
  'We will send a reset link to this email. Only you can open it.': ['Tujja kuweereza linki y\'okukyusa paasiwaadi ku email eno. Ggwe wekka asobola okugiggulawo.', 'Tutatuma kiungo cha kuweka upya nenosiri kwa barua pepe hii. Ni wewe tu unaweza kukifungua.'],
  'Webhook secret hash (make up a long password)': ['Webhook secret hash (yiiya paasiwaadi empanvu)', 'Webhook secret hash (tunga nenosiri refu)'],
  'Welcome': ['Tukwanirizza', 'Karibu'],
  'Welcome back': ['Tukwanirizza nate', 'Karibu tena'],
  'Welcome to SACCO Ledger': ['Tukwanirizza mu SACCO Ledger', 'Karibu SACCO Ledger'],
  'Welcome to {0}': ['Tukwanirizza mu {0}', 'Karibu {0}'],
  'What happens:\n• You leave every group and can no longer sign in to them.\n• Your photo, phone and sign-in history are removed.\n• Past payments and loans stay, with your name, because groups must keep proof.\n\nDownload your data first if you want a copy.': ['Ebibaawo:\n• Ova mu buli kibiina era tokyasobola kubiyingiramu.\n• Ekifaananyi kyo, essimu n\'ebyafaayo by\'okuyingira biggyibwawo.\n• Okusasula n\'amabanja eby\'emabega bisigala, n\'erinnya lyo, kubanga ebibiina birina okukuuma obukakafu.\n\nSooka owanule data yo bw\'oba oyagala kkopi.', 'Kinachotokea:\n• Unatoka kila kikundi na huwezi tena kuingia.\n• Picha yako, simu na historia ya kuingia vinaondolewa.\n• Malipo na mikopo ya zamani inabaki, na jina lako, kwa sababu vikundi lazima vitunze uthibitisho.\n\nPakua data yako kwanza ukitaka nakala.'],
  'What is it for?': ['Kya ki?', 'Ni kwa ajili ya nini?'],
  'What is still owed': ['Ekikyabanjibwa', 'Kinachodaiwa bado'],
  'What is the loan for?': ['Ebbanja lya ki?', 'Mkopo ni wa nini?'],
  'What is {0}?': ['{0} kye ki?', '{0} ni nini?'],
  'What needs you': ['Ebikwetaaga', 'Yanayokuhitaji'],
  'What we keep, why, and your rights.': ['Bye tukuuma, lwaki, n\'eddembe lyo.', 'Tunachotunza, kwa nini, na haki zako.'],
  'What you agreed to, and your copy of your records.': ['Bye wakkiriza, ne kkopi yo ey\'ebiwandiiko byo.', 'Ulichokubali, na nakala yako ya rekodi zako.'],
  'When you pay, your record shows here with a green tick once it is checked.': ['Bw\'osasula, ekiwandiiko kyo kirabika wano n\'akabonero aka kiragala nga kimaze okukeberwa.', 'Ukilipa, rekodi yako huonekana hapa na alama ya kijani ikishakaguliwa.'],
  'Where our savings are going': ['Ssente ze tutereka gye zigenda', 'Akiba yetu inakoenda'],
  'Where the money is': ['Ssente gye ziri', 'Pesa zilipo'],
  'Which licences apply, your group licence and expiry': ['Layisinsi ezeetaagisa, layisinsi y\'ekibiina kyo n\'olunaku lw\'eggwaako', 'Leseni zinazohusika, leseni ya kikundi chako na tarehe ya kuisha'],
  'Who gets what': ['Ani afuna ki', 'Nani anapata nini'],
  'Who has brought what': ['Ani aleese ki', 'Nani ameleta nini'],
  'Who paid what, by cycle. PDF and CSV': ['Ani yasasula ki, buli kiseera. PDF ne CSV', 'Nani alilipa nini, kwa mzunguko. PDF na CSV'],
  'Why?': ['Lwaki?', 'Kwa nini?'],
  'Why? (e.g. agreed in meeting 12)': ['Lwaki? (okugeza kyakkirizibwa mu lukiiko 12)', 'Kwa nini? (mfano ilikubaliwa kwenye mkutano 12)'],
  'Why? (kept in the audit trail)': ['Lwaki? (kikuumibwa mu byafaayo by\'okukebera)', 'Kwa nini? (huwekwa kwenye kumbukumbu za ukaguzi)'],
  'Why? (optional)': ['Lwaki? (si kya buwaze)', 'Kwa nini? (si lazima)'],
  'Withdrawal is more than this member\'s savings.': ['Ssente z\'aggyayo zisinga mmemba ono z\'aterese.', 'Kiasi cha kutoa ni zaidi ya akiba ya mwanachama huyu.'],
  'Withdrawals used {0}': ['Okuggyayo kwakozesa {0}', 'Utoaji umetumia {0}'],
  'Witness 1 (Non-borrower)': ['Omujulizi 1 (Ateewola)', 'Shahidi 1 (Asiye mkopaji)'],
  'Witness 2 (Non-borrower)': ['Omujulizi 2 (Ateewola)', 'Shahidi 2 (Asiye mkopaji)'],
  'Witnesses must be active members.': ['Abajulizi balina okuba bammemba abakola.', 'Mashahidi lazima wawe wanachama hai.'],
  'Works even before they sign up. They choose their own password.': ['Kikola ne bw\'aba tannewandiisa. Yeerondera paasiwaadi ye.', 'Hufanya kazi hata kabla hajajisajili. Anachagua nenosiri lake mwenyewe.'],
  'Write a name and the goal amount.': ['Wandiika erinnya n\'omuwendo gw\'ekigendererwa.', 'Andika jina na kiasi cha lengo.'],
  'Write at least 2 letters.': ['Wandiika ennukuta 2 oba okusingawo.', 'Andika angalau herufi 2.'],
  'Write the date like 2026-12-31.': ['Wandiika olunaku nga 2026-12-31.', 'Andika tarehe kama 2026-12-31.'],
  'Write your name.': ['Wandiika erinnya lyo.', 'Andika jina lako.'],
  'Written legal opinion: "are we a payment service?"': ['Ebbaluwa ya munnamateeka: "tuli kitongole kya kusasula?"', 'Maoni ya wakili kwa maandishi: "je, sisi ni huduma ya malipo?"'],
  'Wrong PIN. {0} tries left, then you must sign in again.': ['PIN nkyamu. Osigazza emirundi {0}, oluvannyuma olina okuddamu okuyingira.', 'PIN si sahihi. Majaribio {0} yamebaki, kisha lazima uingie tena.'],
  'YOU ARE INVITED': ['OYITIDDWA', 'UMEALIKWA'],
  'You': ['Ggwe', 'Wewe'],
  'You already asked. We will handle it soon.': ['Wasabye dda. Tujja kukikolako mangu.', 'Umeshaomba. Tutalishughulikia hivi karibuni.'],
  'You are already in this circle.': ['Oli dda mu kibiina kino.', 'Tayari umo kwenye kikundi hiki.'],
  'You are already in {0}': ['Oli dda mu {0}', 'Tayari uko kwenye {0}'],
  'You are an owner: you can add people, make them owner or admin, and remove them.': ['Oli nnannyini: osobola okwongerako abantu, okubafuula nnannyini oba omukulembeze, n\'okubaggyako.', 'Wewe ni mmiliki: unaweza kuongeza watu, kuwafanya mmiliki au msimamizi, na kuwaondoa.'],
  'You are in {0} {1}': ['Oli mu {0} {1}', 'Uko kwenye {0} {1}'],
  'You are in. Find the circle in My circles.': ['Oyingidde. Ekibiina kisange mu Ebibiina byange.', 'Umeingia. Tafuta kikundi kwenye Vikundi vyangu.'],
  'You are invited to join': ['Oyitiddwa okwegatta ku', 'Umealikwa kujiunga na'],
  'You are invited to join {0}': ['Oyitiddwa okwegatta ku {0}', 'Umealikwa kujiunga na {0}'],
  'You are looking at this circle as the platform team. You can see it, but only its own admin can change it. To run it yourself, invite yourself as its admin from My circles (the circle sees this in its audit trail).': ['Otunuulira ekibiina kino nga ttiimu ya pulatifomu. Osobola okukiraba, naye omukulembeze waakyo yekka y\'asobola okukikyusa. Okukiddukanya ggwe kennyini, weeyite ng\'omukulembeze waakyo okuva mu Ebibiina byange (ekibiina kikiraba mu byafaayo byakyo eby\'okukebera).', 'Unaangalia kikundi hiki kama timu ya jukwaa. Unaweza kukiona, lakini ni msimamizi wake tu anaweza kukibadilisha. Ili kukiendesha mwenyewe, jialike kama msimamizi wake kutoka Vikundi vyangu (kikundi huona hili kwenye kumbukumbu zake za ukaguzi).'],
  'You are not a member of this group.': ['Toli mmemba wa kibiina kino.', 'Wewe si mwanachama wa kikundi hiki.'],
  'You are not an active member of this group.': ['Toli mmemba akola mu kibiina kino.', 'Wewe si mwanachama hai wa kikundi hiki.'],
  'You are not in a circle yet.': ['Tonnaba mu kibiina kyonna.', 'Bado hauko kwenye kikundi.'],
  'You are on the platform team. Your tools (all groups, the people list, invitations) stay locked until two-step sign-in is on. This way a stolen password can never open the whole platform.': ['Oli ku ttiimu ya pulatifomu. Ebikozesebwa byo (ebibiina byonna, olukalala lw\'abantu, okuyita) bisigala nga biggale okutuusa ng\'okuyingira mu mitendera ebiri kuteekeddwako. Bwe kityo paasiwaadi ebbiddwa tesobola kuggulawo pulatifomu yonna.', 'Uko kwenye timu ya jukwaa. Zana zako (vikundi vyote, orodha ya watu, mialiko) hubaki zimefungwa hadi kuingia kwa hatua mbili kuwashwe. Hivyo nenosiri lililoibwa haliwezi kamwe kufungua jukwaa zima.'],
  'You are only looking at this circle. Its admin runs it.': ['Ekibiina kino okitunuulira butunuulizi. Omukulembeze waakyo y\'akiddukanya.', 'Unaangalia tu kikundi hiki. Msimamizi wake ndiye anakiendesha.'],
  'You are ready': ['Oli mwetegefu', 'Uko tayari'],
  'You are {0}': ['Oli {0}', 'Wewe ni {0}'],
  'You can change all of these later in Group Settings.': ['Bino byonna osobola okubikyusa oluvannyuma mu Entegeka z\'ekibiina.', 'Unaweza kubadilisha haya yote baadaye kwenye Mipangilio ya Kikundi.'],
  'You can forgive up to {0} now.': ['Osobola okusonyiwa okutuuka ku {0} kaakano.', 'Unaweza kusamehe hadi {0} sasa.'],
  'You can hide these (i) buttons in My Account → Look and language.': ['Obupeesa buno (i) osobola okubukweka mu Akawunti yange → Endabika n\'olulimi.', 'Unaweza kuficha vitufe hivi (i) kwenye Akaunti yangu → Mwonekano na lugha.'],
  'You can invite people only to a circle you run.': ['Osobola okuyita abantu mu kibiina ky\'oddukanya kyokka.', 'Unaweza kualika watu kwenye kikundi unachokiendesha tu.'],
  'You can only apply for your own loan.': ['Osobola okusaba ebbanja lyo lyokka.', 'Unaweza kuomba mkopo wako mwenyewe tu.'],
  'You can only claim for yourself.': ['Osobola okwesabira wekka.', 'Unaweza kudai kwa ajili yako mwenyewe tu.'],
  'You can only pay for yourself.': ['Osobola okwesasulira wekka.', 'Unaweza kujilipia wewe mwenyewe tu.'],
  'You can only record your own payments.': ['Osobola okuwandiika by\'osasula ggwe byokka.', 'Unaweza kurekodi malipo yako mwenyewe tu.'],
  'You can only see your own statement.': ['Osobola okulaba sitatimenti yo yokka.', 'Unaweza kuona taarifa yako mwenyewe tu.'],
  'You can see everything, to check it. You change nothing.': ['Osobola okulaba byonna, okubikebera. Tolina ky\'okyusa.', 'Unaweza kuona kila kitu, ili kukagua. Hubadilishi chochote.'],
  'You cannot block yourself.': ['Tosobola kweziyiza.', 'Huwezi kujizuia mwenyewe.'],
  'You cannot change your own role. Ask another admin.': ['Tosobola kukyusa kifo kyo. Saba omukulembeze omulala.', 'Huwezi kubadilisha nafasi yako mwenyewe. Mwombe msimamizi mwingine.'],
  'You cannot deactivate yourself.': ['Tosobola kweyimiriza.', 'Huwezi kujisimamisha mwenyewe.'],
  'You cannot reset your own password here. Ask two other officers.': ['Tosobola kukyusa password yo wano. Saba abakulembeze abalala babiri.', 'Huwezi kubadilisha nenosiri lako hapa. Waombe viongozi wengine wawili.'],
  'You check and confirm the money records.': ['Okebera n\'okakasa ebiwandiiko by\'essente.', 'Unakagua na kuthibitisha rekodi za pesa.'],
  'You get an SMS. It has a transaction ID.': ['Ofuna SMS. Erimu ID y\'okusasula.', 'Unapata SMS. Ina ID ya muamala.'],
  'You keep the members list and the meetings.': ['Okuuma olukalala lwa bammemba n\'enkiiko.', 'Unatunza orodha ya wanachama na mikutano.'],
  'You look at loan requests.': ['Otunuulira okusaba kw\'amabanja.', 'Unaangalia maombi ya mikopo.'],
  'You need your current password.': ['Weetaaga paasiwaadi yo eriwo kati.', 'Unahitaji nenosiri lako la sasa.'],
  'You run this circle: settings, roles and checks.': ['Oddukanya ekibiina kino: entegeka, ebifo n\'okukebera.', 'Unaendesha kikundi hiki: mipangilio, majukumu na ukaguzi.'],
  'You save, borrow and see your own records.': ['Otereka, weewola era olaba ebiwandiiko byo.', 'Unaweka akiba, unakopa na kuona rekodi zako.'],
  'You see totals only. To look inside a circle, its admin must open a 24-hour window. Every look is written in that circle\'s record.': ['Olaba migatte gyokka. Okutunula munda mu kibiina, omukulembeze waakyo alina okuggulawo eddirisa ery\'essaawa 24. Buli kutunula kuwandiikibwa mu biwandiiko by\'ekibiina ekyo.', 'Unaona jumla tu. Ili kuangalia ndani ya kikundi, msimamizi wake lazima afungue dirisha la saa 24. Kila mtazamo huandikwa kwenye rekodi ya kikundi hicho.'],
  'Your big buttons': ['Obupeesa bwo obunene', 'Vitufe vyako vikubwa'],
  'Your circle': ['Ekibiina kyo', 'Kikundi chako'],
  'Your circles stay separate. Money and members never mix between them.': ['Ebibiina byo bisigala nga byawuddwa. Ssente ne bammemba tebyetabula wakati waabyo.', 'Vikundi vyako hubaki tofauti. Pesa na wanachama havichanganyiki kamwe kati yao.'],
  'Your details for this circle': ['Ebikukwatako mu kibiina kino', 'Taarifa zako kwa kikundi hiki'],
  'Your full name': ['Amannya go gonna', 'Jina lako kamili'],
  'Your group\'s OWN merchant codes or numbers. Members pay here directly. The app never receives this money.': ['Koodi oba ennamba z\'obusuubuzi ez\'ekibiina kyo ZENNYINI. Bammemba basasula wano butereevu. App tefuna ssente zino n\'akatono.', 'Misimbo au namba za mfanyabiashara za kikundi chako CHENYEWE. Wanachama hulipa hapa moja kwa moja. Programu haipokei pesa hizi kamwe.'],
  'Your lawyer, then Bank of Uganda if needed': ['Munnamateeka wo, oluvannyuma Bank of Uganda bwe kiba kyetaagisa', 'Wakili wako, kisha Bank of Uganda ikihitajika'],
  'Your money records stay, as groups must keep proof.': ['Ebiwandiiko by\'essente zo bisigala, kubanga ebibiina birina okukuuma obukakafu.', 'Rekodi zako za pesa zinabaki, kwa sababu vikundi lazima vitunze uthibitisho.'],
  'Your money, one look': ['Ssente zo, mu kutunula kumu', 'Pesa zako, kwa mtazamo mmoja'],
