  'Your platform tools will stop working until you turn it on again.': ['Ebikozesebwa byo ebya pulatifomu bijja kulekera awo okukola okutuusa lw\'onookiteekako nate.', 'Zana zako za jukwaa zitaacha kufanya kazi hadi uiwashe tena.'],
  'Your real email. We send a link to prove it is yours.': ['Email yo entuufu. Tuweereza linki okukakasa nti yiyo.', 'Barua pepe yako halisi. Tunatuma kiungo kuthibitisha ni yako.'],
